roject_duration'])?>" placeholder="e.g. 6 weeks"></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Short Description</label><textarea name="short_description" class="form-control" rows="3" required><?=$esc($project['short_description'])?></textarea></div></div><h2 class="h5 border-bottom pb-2">Case Study Story</h2><div class="row g-3 mb-4"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Project Scope</label><textarea name="project_scope" class="form-control" rows="5"><?=$esc($project['project_scope'])?></textarea></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Objectives</label><textarea name="objectives" class="form-control" rows="5"><?=$esc($project['objectives'])?></textarea></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Challenge</label><textarea name="challenge" class="form-control" rows="6"><?=$esc($project['challenge'])?></textarea></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Strategy</label><textarea name="strategy" class="form-control" rows="6"><?=$esc($project['strategy'])?></textarea></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Solution</label><textarea name="solution" class="form-control" rows="6"><?=$esc($project['solution'])?></textarea></div><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Key Features</label><textarea name="key_features" class="form-control" rows="6"><?=$esc($project['key_features'])?></textarea></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Results / Outcomes</label><textarea name="results" class="form-control" rows="5"><?=$esc($project['results'])?></textarea></div><div class="col-12"><label class="form-label">Technologies</label><input name="technologies" class="form-control" value="<?=$esc($project['technologies'])?>" placeholder="PHP, MySQL, Bootstrap, JavaScript"></div></div><h2 class="h5 border-bottom pb-2">Media & Links</h2><div class="row g-3 mb-4"><div class="col-md-6"><label class="form-label">Hero Image URL / Path</label><input name="featured_image" class="form-control" value="<?=$esc(